      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "14d4495d3c3c4de391fa4d515ecd877e_18",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Even after filing of the replies by the respondents, the petitioner has not filed the complete copy of the license therefore,\nadverse inference has to be drawn and 3 WP-5601-2024 Committee has rightly rejected the tender."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d6338a579be44cc9b8f01578edc8ed5f_19",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nIn the contractual matters, terms and conditions of the tender has to be interpreted strictly."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "268739b1403d49219de02838b4eec6cd_20",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "7. In view of the aforesaid, we do not find any case for interference under Article 226 of the Constitution of India."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5614b64f53de4bd1a21be9173d2ae6f0_21",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
